					"Apply 25 kg ZnSO₄/ha if zinc deficiency",
					"FYM: 10-15 tonnes/ha at field preparation"
				],
				irrigation: [
					"First irrigation: 15-20 DAS",
					"Critical stages: Tasseling, silking, and grain filling",
					"Total: 6-8 irrigations depending on rainfall",
					"Avoid water stress during flowering and grain development"
				],
				pestManagement: [
					"Stem borer: Apply Carbofuran 3G [at] 20 kg/ha in whorl",
					"Fall armyworm: Spray Emamectin benzoate 5% SG [at] 0.4g/L",
					"Shoot fly: Use carbofuran 3G [at] 8-10 kg/ha at sowing",
					"Turcicum leaf blight: Spray Mancozeb 75% WP [at] 2g/L",
					"Maydis leaf blight: Use resistant varieties"
				],
				recommendation: "Maize requires well-drained soil and adequate moisture during flowering and grain filling. Monitor for fall armyworm and stem borer. Use hybrid varieties and ensure timely weed management for better productivity."
			},
			{
				id: 4,
				name: "Tomato",
				scientificName: "Solanum lycopersicum",
				season: "kharif",
				icon: "🍅",
				color: "#fee2e2",
